Steps to run Lind Facil Stack

1. Compile full lamp stack via src/scripts/lamp/compile_lamp.sh and load via load_lamp.sh
2. Remove makefile, cp makefile-nacl as makefile
3. Run bootstrap_nacl
4. Load facil related files via ./load_facil.sh
5. Initialize postgres via: lind /bin/bash init_postgres.sh
6. Run lind facil stack via: lind /bin/bash facil_lind_stack.sh
